<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEP" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Zefania</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zefania</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zefania</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zefania</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow risi Zefania chekhai, now arui khin dow 621-612 BC takra kowi chekhai. Aia dow aia maru Judauüa tut-e kowh krawi tek lai mih risi chekhai. Pur pra laiklow Zefania tekla mih dow mang Josia chowm mang mih 640-609 BC takra kowi chekhai. Nami pur pra laiklow Zefania tekla mih dow Jerusalem kowi aia uowi khe chepaw naia kown. Aia kowh pur pra laiklow dow 2 Manguüa 21-23 lawng kowi hai Jeremia auown lawng prakowi arui uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami Zefania bowih chalachow mih kowi dow “CHAKRAMANG kowh ni” pami laiklow arui uowi ranit kat chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi kowh lang pankri mih laiklow dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ni khe chenchap maten chün lai dowi rakowi chenchap maten kowi Thurai naripah kown mih, now Judauüa kowi paw nachet pe tara kown mih lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Zefania tek mih, “Thurai dow aia nau kaah kown mih ringkawra naka kown mih lainowmma süngür khai. Aia dow aia maru-uüa arup aren kowi chupiia mih sak-ih dowi chekhai. Aia dow chet tara nowm reng (3:5 uan), now aia maru-uüa kowh ransu-uüa luk kowi aia awng reng (3:15 uan) pami aia natüngah kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Judauüa kowi naripah kown mih 1:1-18</para>
  <para style="io1">Tarip kown mih hawk lai 2:1-3</para>
  <para style="io1">Akeng chenchapuüa piak mih 2:4-15</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem hai akeng chenchapuüa vüi tawi tuak krat mih 3:1-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Kaah sakowmma uowi miuüa kowi peah sakklamra satang mih 3:9-20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:1" />Juda pren kowi Amawn chapa Josia chowm mang khe Zefania tut-e CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang ting khai. Zefania kowh pa dow Kusi, Kusi kowh pa dow Gedalia, Gedalia kowh pa dow Amaria, now Amaria kowh pa dow Hezekia chekhai.<verse eid="ZEP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judauüa kowi naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:2">“Lusa kowi kowh uowi mih maten kowi asaima ang napiakta kown.<verse eid="ZEP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:3" />Lusa maru hai asadua maten ang nachumta bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:3">kuang kowi kowh uakling uaber hai sata kowi kowh dam maten paw ang nachumta kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 1:3">Maru ngakuüa kowi ang nauang pawla pe piakra kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:3">lusa kowi kowh maru maten kowi ang napiakta bowk kown.<verse eid="ZEP 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:4" />“Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uowi miuüa maten kowi ang naripah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:4">Baal thurai kowi chupiiala mih uanh maten hai arup kowi chupiia mih uamowuüa maten kowi mami pren hownia asaima ang napiakah kown.<verse eid="ZEP 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:5" />Kowmatia kimluk kowi kowpün hanow sat, krek hai lama kowi kowchupiia miuüa kowi ang napiakah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:5">Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia se kham sawi kung kowi Molek thurai ming hown plan kham sawi miuüa kowi paw ang napiakah kown.<verse eid="ZEP 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:6" />Ang tiama hownia cham dang miuüa hai ang low iawng mang dowi miuüa kowi ang napiakta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:6">now ang naukrang tuk kown nau dowi miuüa kowi paw ang napiakta kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEP 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:7" />Enni mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai pur kowi ririmma uowi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh tara chet ni dow uang tawn iawlaw khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 1:7">CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowh maru Judauüa kowi nasaita kownkow kamrütta hüah khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:7">chang phuchua iawng amatni kowi nauang saiah kownkow amatni kowh ransu-uüa kowi aia uang pawla pe khowk.<verse eid="ZEP 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:8" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang chet tara mih ni khe Judauüa kowh maru iukuüa kowi ang naripah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:8">mang chauüa hai prenlang thuraiuüa kowi chupiia miuüa maten kowi ang naripah kown.<verse eid="ZEP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:9" />Nami ni khe dow arup kowi chupiia miuüa kowi ang naripah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:9">now amatni kowh mang kim kowi atekma naia towla uanh kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:9">krawi chang nowng miuüa hai krawi kuan miuüa kowi paw ang naripah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEP 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:10" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek mih, “Nami ni khe dow Dam Tapplawt hownia kar klow natarua phawnglawng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:10">marow kowi kowh Arah Sar hownia dow nguk klow nata kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:10">now hungh hownia dow kimkrowng tim mih klow nata kown.<verse eid="ZEP 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:11" />Jerusalem marow chi ria kowi kowh Maktesuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:11">enni mih kar büah nguk büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 1:11">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowi kowh kun chang miuüa nauowi kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:11">nakowi kowh tangka pawisa kun chang miuüa kowi dow nakowngta bowk kown.<verse eid="ZEP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:12" />Nami khin khe dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh aiiuma mih arah maten kowi maibu hown ang nakrawi towrah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:12">Kowmatia luk kowi sak-ih se ‘Aiung angak chang chepaw CHAKRAMANG dow tawngpaw nachang kown nadowi’ pah tek miuüa kowi dow ang naripah kown.<verse eid="ZEP 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:13" />Amatni kowh dawngthawnguan dow maru narupta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:13">now amatni kowh kim üa ün dow maru napiakta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 1:13">Amatni chang kim sar chepaw naka uowiah büah kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:13">now chang grep krum büah chepaw naka kham grep tui büah kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEP 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:14" />CHAKRAMANG kowh tara chet ni dow uang tawn khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:14">Nami dow alenma uang ting kown chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 1:14">Nami dow lainowmma krat pusara ni chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:14">nami khin khe dow akürma mih maru-uüa khowm nakar kown.<verse eid="ZEP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:15" />Nami ni dow CHAKRAMANG kunmarau mih ni naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:15">nami ni dow akrat pusara hai tuak kratra ni naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 1:15">Nami ni dow phih hai piakra ni naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:15">nami ni dow uariiu süngkuak mih ni hai uangnim aiiuma mih ni naown kown.<verse eid="ZEP 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:16" />Nami ni dow tap tapat lut mih marow maten kowi senah mih ni naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:16">nami ni dow marow nui kowi kowh kangchawngra kim maten kowi senah mih ni naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:16">now baw tün hai nahaw tasen kown mih ni naown kown.<verse eid="ZEP 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:17" />Maru kawmuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih angak chang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:17">naiawng rakowi amatni dow mikdu miuüa iawng namang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 1:17">Amatni kowh vi dow dinchow dawng kowi nahawrla dawi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:17">now amatni kowh uak dow krawng kowi natakuakla pan kown.<verse eid="ZEP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:18" />CHAKRAMANG kunmarau mih ni khe dow tawng chap paw amatni kowi naia lawngah kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:18">amatni kowh kuh hai tai paw amatni kowi naia lawngah kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 1:18">CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh khowrbown dawma mih maih iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:18">lün pluplup mih hown lusa kowi uowi mih maten asaima nakamta kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 1:18">Lusa kowi uowi mih maten kowi dow linlanma sang asaima aia nachumta kown.<verse eid="ZEP 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEP 2" />
  <para style="s">Tarip kown mih hawk lai</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:1" />Aw rukrai uowi dowi mih Juda chenchapuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:1">enni mih tarip büa diah.<verse eid="ZEP 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:2" />Khowm bowkta mih tara chet khin uang ting dowi rawn tarip büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:2">maih iawng lün pluplup mih CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura uang ting dowi rawn tarip büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:2">now aia kowh sak-hiara uang ting dowi rawn tarip büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 2:2">Enni che tarip dowi now li hutla chapli iawng nahutla enni kown chowbowt.<verse eid="ZEP 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:3" />Judauüa pungmadawng kowi kowh khamsum khamdaw miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:3">CHAKRAMANG kowi cham büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:3">now aia kowh ana pek chün büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 2:3">Anowm kowi cham büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:3">now khamsum khamdawma hown uowi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 2:3">Nahanow CHAKRAMANG mih phih hownia natowkala enni chepaw naia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:3">piakra ni uang ting mih khin khe aia kowh kunmaraura hownia enni nakhalat chepaw naia.<verse eid="ZEP 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filistinuüa kowi naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:4" />Filistinuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG ripah mih khin khe Gaza marow kowi paw naripla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:4">nami khin khe Askelawn marow kowi paw aia mih naripla kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 2:4">Asdawd marowchakuüa kowi dow ni ür thüm khe naprütah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:4">nakhowk khe Ekrawn marowchakuüa kowi paw naprütah kown.<verse eid="ZEP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:5" />Sata pang kowi uowi mih Filistin krungchak Keretuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:5">enni luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 2:5">Kanan pren kowi uowi mih Filistinuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:5">enni luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 2:5">Enni lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek kingküa lai mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:5">“Lowk iachow khowm ta sing dowi pat asaima ang napiakta enni kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:6" />Sata pang kowi kowh Filistinuüa kowh krawng bawn dow tawncher thing rah chowtaih naiung kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:6">Nakowi dow tawncher thing miuüa kowh te hai ruapur kim chowtaih nauowi kown.<verse eid="ZEP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:7" />Nami arah dow Juda chenchap ta sing miuüa napowngta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:7">now nakowi dow amatni naka ruapur thing rah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 2:7">Iak-e khe dow Askelawn marow kowi kowh akhawma mih kim kowi naiak büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai mih naming nakhetah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:7">now amatni kowi dow auown khe kowh iawng aia naplan peah iungra iawk kown.<verse eid="ZEP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moabuüa hai Amawnuüa kowi naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:8-9" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:8-9">“Ang maru-uüa kowi Moabuüa hai Amawnuüa peah rukrai mih hai prawng renah mih ang ta khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:8-9">Nami klen kowi ang maru-uüa kowh pren nakhünta pe kown pahai chang bawri mih paw ang ta khowk</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 2:8-9">Naiawng rakowi takham se ang tek khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:8-9">Moabuüa hai Amawnuüa kowi dow Sawdawm hai Gawmawra marowchakuüa kowi iawng ang napiakah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 2:8-9">Naiawngün arah dow chuh mung hai a-ikma mih krawng nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:8-9">now chowngchowng saksakma vüi apiaknama mih krawng bawn nachowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 2:8-9">Ang maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi kowh ta sing miuüa amatni kowh dawngthawnguan narupta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:8-9">now amatni kowh pren napowngta pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEP 2:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:10" />Moabuüa hai Amawnuüa luk kowi naiawng ripra nauang ting kown mih dow amatni bawri rakowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:10">now lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa kowi khareah büah rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="ZEP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:11" />CHAKRAMANG dow amatni kowi natüng pe kram kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:11">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow palusama kowi kowh akeng thuraiuüa maten kowi napiakta bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 2:11">Nami khin khe alakma mih pren kowi kowh chenchapuüa mih chowlowkkow uowi rah hownia CHAKRAMANG kowi nachup naiiaah kown.<verse eid="ZEP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ethiawpiauüa hai Asuriauüa kowi naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:12" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ethiawpiauüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:12">enni paw ang kowh saidawng hown nakowng bowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEP 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:13" />CHAKRAMANG dow tawngphak prakowi iaw rut hanow Asuria prenchakuüa kowi napiakah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:13">now Ninevi marow kowi dow asaima napiakta hanow süngrüp süngkangma iawng müakangma aia natowah kown.<verse eid="ZEP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:14" />Nakowi dow chia kawm, ruapur kawm hai asadua chap maten namawkla rim kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:14">Kimchüng kowi ün dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh bungku hai kaurawng kowi kowh bungku naiak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:14">now tawngpawk kowi ün krawi mown hanow nakrawi lai kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 2:14">Kim maten dow napiak bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:14">now sidar singh hown kowh phen ün dow maru napawta kown.<verse eid="ZEP 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:15" />Nami marow dow kramra uowi dowi hai asowrma uowi mih chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:15">Aia tatek mih, “Ang towbowt, ang klen kowi miapaw uowi dowk,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 2:15">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow nami marow piak khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:15">now chowng kaurawng uaramchak hawmh uowi rah khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 2:15">Nami tapiak mih marow ria iawng kowmang miuüa maten dow naprawng renah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 2:15">now marow piak mih kowi chitah mih iawng hown natüngla rutma büah kown.<verse eid="ZEP 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEP 3" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:1" />Sürlawkma mih Jerusalem marow luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:1">Nami marow dow kingküa dawma miuüa hai tasai sak miuüa tek khai bowt.<verse eid="ZEP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:2" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sünta dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:2">now aia kowh pringhawi laiklow paw chün dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:2">Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:2">now amatni kowh Thurai tut-e tatawn kown paw nau dowi.<verse eid="ZEP 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:3" />Nakowi kowh aluchowuüa dow hek rangrang mih krangsi iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:3">now nakowi kowh tara chet miuüa dow uariiu rü khe kowh krawi lim chak mih sui iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:3">Amatni dow arangpranma panow lawphama kangowh chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:3">amatni kaah mih srui dow auai rau vüi towah dowi bowt kowi chata bowk reng chekhai.<verse eid="ZEP 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:4" />Jerusalem kowi kowh risiuüa dow bawrima hai dailama chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:4">amatni dow kaah sakowm dowi mih maru chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:4">Uamowuüa dow Thurai kowh ana pek kowi kingküa khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:4">naiawng hown amatni dow Thurai chup kim sürlawkta reng.<verse eid="ZEP 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:5" />Nachenganchepaw amatni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih CHAKRAMANG dow anowmma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:5">aia dow tawngpaw anowm nadowi mih chang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:5">now aia dow rau towng tamata dowi kowi chet tara nowm reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:5">Tawkche lup ngak chang miuüa dow tuk rukrai dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ZEP 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:6" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Chenchapuüa kowi ang chumta bowk khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:6">amatni kowh kangchawngra kimkrowng ang piakta pe bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:6">Amatni kowh tiama ün akhaw aklaima towbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:6">naiawngün tiama kowi miapaw mang dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:6">Amatni kowh marow maten asaima piak bowk khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:6">nakowi dow miapaw uowi dowi bowt.<verse eid="ZEP 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:7" />Nakhowk khe ang tatuak mih, ‘Khaleng dow ang maru-uüa nakram ang ngengche bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:7">now ang kowh pringhawi laiklow nachün bowt,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:7">Naiawng che chang büah e dow amatni kowh uowi rah ang napiak pe kown nadowi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:7">now ang kowh ripra maten paw amatni luk kowi ang nauang pe tingah kown nadowi diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:7">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow süngürma hown chang lup ngak reng chekhai.<verse eid="ZEP 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:8" />Aw Jerusalem marowchakuüa, ang vüi kowi hawt chawng diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:8">Chenchapuüa kowi napeah aprek kown mih lai natek kownkow ang narü kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:8">nami ni vüi hawt chawng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:8">Chenchapuüa kowi nakua nalawmah kownkow ang khowm bowkta khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:8">pren ün kowi ang nakua nalawmah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:8">Amatni luk kowi mapaw ang sak-ih dowi mih ang nakhük pe kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:8">ang kowh kunmarau lün pluplup mih ang nauang hüng pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:8">Ang kowh kunmaraura maih hown palusama napiak kown.<verse eid="ZEP 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:9" />Nami kung kowi dow maru kawmuüa kowh laiklow ang nachimsai pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:9">Nahanow amatni dow naia kiowri ang kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:9">now akrüp angi sang naia chupiia ang büah kown towbowt.<verse eid="ZEP 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:10" />Ethiawpia pren kowi kowh aw paipra pown hownia chupiia ang miuüa nauang pawla ang uanap kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:10">cham taset plawt mih ang kowh maru-uüa ang vüi nauang pawla uanap kown.<verse eid="ZEP 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:11" />Nami ni khe dow alai kowh en kingküa ang mih rakowi en narukrai kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:11">Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami marow hownia mih chang bawri miuüa hai chang owrow miuüa kowi ang naprütta bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:11">Nakowi kowh ang kowh chimsaima mih hungh luk kowi miapaw nachang bawri kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ZEP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:12" />CHAKRAMANG ming kowi neplawng nesak miuüa kowi dow en lak kowi ang natowah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:12">anemchow tanü mih hai khamsum khamdawma miuüa kowi dow en lak kowi ang natowah kown.<verse eid="ZEP 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:13" />Israel kowi kowh ta sing uowi miuüa dow nachang lup ngak kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:13">amatni dow nadai kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:13">now natakuan büah kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:13">Amatni dow ki chata chakkham kung kowi thaulangma namüi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:13">amatni kowi miapaw nakrawkah kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEP 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel kowh piaw meng</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:14" />Aw Zaiawn chama, tek meng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:14">aw Israel, how diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:14">Aw Jerusalem, awmrawm büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:14">now saktuak maten hown piaw büa diah.<verse eid="ZEP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:15" />CHAKRAMANG dow enni kowh ripra taingta enni khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:15">now aia dow enni kowh ransu-uüa kowi prütta bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:15">Israel pren mang CHAKRAMANG dow enni pungmadawng kowi tawi uowi reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:15">Naiawng rakowi angak kowi katpaw enni nakram kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="ZEP 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:16" />Nami khin khe Jerusalem kowi maru natek pe kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:16">“Aw Jerusalem, hangkow kram diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:16">now hangkow sak nen diah.<verse eid="ZEP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:17" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih enni pungmadawng kowi tawi uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:17">aia tut-e dow nalawng enni kown mih kür uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:17">Aia dow enni rakowi nowm nowm naawmrawm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:17">now kramra takcha thaulangra aia nape enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:17">Aia dow enni lawnguan kowi atünma natek meng kown.<verse eid="ZEP 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh laiklow Hebrai lai hown uowi mih chim dowi chekhai.</char>
    </note>“Pawi khe kowh maru piaw iawng Thurai mih napiaw hai natek meng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:18">enni kowh taprüa taiia khin chur khowk, kawmat dow enni naia piaw bowt kown.<verse eid="ZEP 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:19" />Nami khin khe dow chang enni nowng miuüa maten kowi ang naripah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:19">Akawm akrat hown uowi miuüa kowi dow ang nalawngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:19">now cham tauet plawt miuüa kowi dow ang nakuaah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:19">Amatni ka rukrai mih takcha ang napeah kiowrira kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:19">now palusama kowi amatni kowi ang napeah ringkawra kown.<verse eid="ZEP 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:20" />Aw Jerusalem, nami khin khe dow akeng pren kowi kowh uowi mih en maru-uüa kowi ang nauang pawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:20">now amatni kowh uowi rah kowi ang naplan pe uowiah iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:20">Ang pe iuksown enni iawk mih dow chenchap maten nakhi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:20">now amatni dow naringkaw enni hai nakiowri enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:20">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="ZEP 3:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 3" />
</usx>